[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0010","text":"给，制片人先生\n您要的问卷"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0020","text":"嗯……啊，日花啊\n谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0030","text":"那我先走啦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0040","text":"啊，等等\n日花，能耽误一下吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0050","text":"之前拍的那组，成品出来了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0060","text":"……啊——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0070","text":"那组只有衣服好看的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0080","text":"……如果只有衣服好看的话，我是不会点头的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0090","text":"不是说过了吗？　表情很好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0100","text":"你看看，喏\n……会是很棒的版面哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12400100_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
